# Final local frontend physical audit

Actual Vivado2022.2 routed `df_front_context`, L4/C4/B8/T8, xcu280-fsvh2892-2L-e,
5ns. Core and real one-entry launch/capture registers are included. External
synchronous IO contract is min0.100/max0.800ns in all A/B/C attempts; these are
stated boundary assumptions, not measured board IO. No clock or IO constraint was
relaxed and no timing exception/waiver was introduced.

C: setup WNS+0.255ns,TNS0,0 failing; hold WHS+0.019ns,THS0,0 failing;
pulse WPWS+1.968ns,0 failing. All12 `check_timing` categories zero.
`report_methodology` reports0violations. Explicit RTSTAT route DRC separately
reports one RTSTAT-10 warning covering857nets. Actual-object audit classifies all
857 as EXTERNAL_OUTPUT_ONLY, with zero internal sink pins. These are the OOC
boundary nets after the actual capture registers and handshake endpoints; they
are not qualified external interconnect. No warning was waived. All15,550 routable
nets are fully routed, routing errors0. No negative max/min path found.

The original known pos/slot path remains constrained: final worst pos->slot_state
slack+1.991ns,7levels,2CARRY8,2.903ns data delay. The worst sequential-to-sequential
path within actual FP32 lanes has+1.883ns slack. Worst path to any error register
is descriptor-state->core error,+0.824ns. Global worst is slot_state->captured cost
operand,+0.255ns,14levels/no CARRY8,4.727ns data (3.339ns routing,70.639%).

A pre-absolute-EDGE attempt had WNS-0.650ns/57endpoints,hold+0.007ns.
B includes true EDGE base and had WNS-0.335ns/6endpoints,hold+0.011ns.
Both are retained. A/B script tails called unsupported Tcl `redirect` only after
route DCP and primary reports had been saved. Read-only check_timing/write_xdc/
flat-utilization completed without rerouting; original rc1 and recovery rc0 are
separate receipts. C uses supported2022.2 text commands and returned0 directly.

C repairs are actual RTL: legality checks registered operands in existing stage1;
per-context linked indices into the SAME finite beat slots replace wide position/
beat matching. Twelve complete interface traces are byte-identical to B-source
functional results; no latency, II or data capacity change. Empty enqueue and
one-/many-slot pop+enqueue corners are covered in independent cycle replay.

C resource use:9247LUT(1278LUTRAM),8761FF,0BRAM/URAM/DSP. B used10251LUT and9452FF.
RAM inference remains distributed LUTRAM for small descriptor/context/edgepayload/
cost arrays, no hidden HLS/IP arithmetic. Sixteen copies give arithmetic bookkeeping
147952LUT/140176FF/20448LUTRAM, excluding globalnetwork,sharedoutputRAM,POP,directory,
backend and globalclock/routing. This is NOT a full-design fit or timing claim.

Status: LOCAL_RTL_TIMING_QUALIFIED for this exact L4 context and boundary contract.
L8 has functional/cycle evidence but no separate routed clock qualification.
Complete kernel clock qualified=false; board_measured=false.
